ere they left off but  pick up before they left off the  original six episode run of dhmas ended  with the calendar in the background  changing days from june 19th to june  20th we've moved forward in time we've  progressed red guy pulled the plug on  his ad heavy children show and decided  to independently produce it on youtube  there was hope there was new opportunity  but now we've regressed the calendar and  fly has reset to june 19th resetting the  date seems to be meant to tell us that  history is repeating we're making the  same mistakes we are stuck in a negative  cycle like duck ignoring the problems or  a yellow guy who doesn't know enough to  recognize history when he sees it we're  going to be reliving the same issues  over and over again we keep swatting the  fly but calling it a b we keep treating  the symptoms but not addressing the root  problem maybe we as viewers didn't do a  good enough job of recognizing the  problems around us so dhmas new season  will be us reliving them again until we  can get it right looks like the show is  trying to teach us something after all  and not just about nutrition but the bad  not healthy foods are very rude and must  leave through the cat flap that doesn't  make sense  also guess we're gonna have to wait  until september to find out more suppose  it gives me time to figure out how to  watch shows that are currently airing on  the bbc but hey that's just a theory a  film theory and cuts and hey if you want  to catch up on our previous theories on  don't hug me i'm scared you should check  them out because they're on screen right  now we dove deep into the lore of the  franchise and i cannot wait to see what  this new show has in store for us  speaking of if you don't want to miss  our analysis of the dhmas tv show when  it hits hit the subscribe button it will  not guarantee you see those videos but  will at least increase the likelihood  [Music]

